3.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-14T00:35:28Z"},"body":"Partially Addresses: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/9161\r\nRelated: #88709, #106164 \r\n\r\nThe inspiration for this PR was #106164 and the desire to set a custom color for the `Output` and `Debugger` tabs now that they are within a TabBar, but there is a desire to do such, as evidenced by the previous proposal.\r\n\r\nCurrently it is impossible to set colors individually for tabs in a TabBar. This PR adds support to set custom overrides for the selected, unselected, hovered, and disabled colors on a *per tab* basis.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"429\" alt=\"TabBar with Rainbow-Colored Tabs\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6fbde07c-60c4-4656-9c1e-c3f00a2c8d90\" />\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106263/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":5},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106263/timeline","performed_via_github_app":nu